title: Kurt Rosenfeld
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, left
card-image: img/portraits/RosenfeldKurt.jpg
view-if: rosenfeld_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Kurt Rosenfeld

Rosenfeld [? if chancellor = "Rosenfeld": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Rosenfeld": the current President and ?] works as a lawyer in Berlin who defends left-wing individuals and causes. He favors cooperation with the [+ uspd_name +] and a path of class struggle for the [+ spd_name +].

- @building_the_left
- @uspd_cooperation
- @against_toleration
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the [+ spd_name +] to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 6; left_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent += 2

We have increased the strength of the left faction of the [+ spd_name +].

@uspd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the [+ uspd_name +]
subtitle: Push the party to be more friendly towards the [+ uspd_name +].
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; uspd_relation += 4*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2; communist_coalition += 1 if uspd_cooperation_seen <= 1; uspd_cooperation_seen += 1

Through his work, Rosenfeld has defended individual [+ uspd_name +] members; this should make some connections possible.

@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
view-if: not constructive_vonc
subtitle: Break our current toleration arrangement, and bring down the government via a no-confidence vote.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_toleration == 0 : The [+ spd_name +] is not currently in toleration. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and spd_toleration
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; spd_toleration = 0; left_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 4; new_middle_spd -= 3; rural_spd -= 3; old_middle_spd -= 3; catholics_spd -= 3; reformist_dissent += 8

We have grown tired of the burdens of toleration, and have called a vote of no confidence in the current minority government.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Rosenfeld can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Rosenfeld"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Rosenfeld can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Rosenfeld"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "[+ spd_name +]" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: reichsexekution
